---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const url = 'https://barmooncontracting.com/services/kitchen-bath-remodeling-killeen-tx';

const pageSchemas = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'Service',
    serviceType: 'Kitchen & Bath Remodeling',
    name: 'Kitchen & Bath Remodeling in Killeen, TX',
    description:
      'Kitchen and bath remodels in Killeen and Fort Cavazos–area homes—durable finishes, smart layouts, and schedules that work for busy households.',
    provider: { '@type': 'GeneralContractor', name: 'Bar Moon Contracting', url: 'https://barmooncontracting.com/' },
    areaServed: [
      { '@type': 'City', name: 'Killeen, TX' },
      { '@type': 'AdministrativeArea', name: 'Bell County, TX' },
    ],
    url,
  },
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
    itemListElement: [
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://barmooncontracting.com/' },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Services', item: 'https://barmooncontracting.com/services' },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: 'Kitchen & Bath Remodeling in Killeen, TX', item: url },
    ],
  },
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'FAQPage',
    mainEntity: [
      {
        '@type': 'Question',
        name: 'How long does a kitchen or bath remodel take in Killeen?',
        acceptedAnswer: {
          '@type': 'Answer',
          text: 'Most standard kitchen or bath remodels run about 3–6 weeks depending on scope, plumbing/electrical changes, and material lead times. We lock a realistic schedule before demo.',
        },
      },
      {
        '@type': 'Question',
        name: 'Can my family stay in the home during a Killeen remodel?',
        acceptedAnswer: {
          '@type': 'Answer',
          text: 'Yes for most projects. We contain dust, protect pathways, and sequence work so you keep a functioning bathroom or temporary kitchen plan when possible.',
        },
      },
      {
        '@type': 'Question',
        name: 'Do you remodel older Killeen and Fort Cavazos–area homes?',
        acceptedAnswer: {
          '@type': 'Answer',
          text: 'Yes. Many area homes have dated layouts, limited storage, and plumbing or electrical that needs updating. We plan for surprises behind walls without abandoning the budget process.',
        },
      },
      {
        '@type': 'Question',
        name: 'What materials hold up in Killeen kitchens and baths?',
        acceptedAnswer: {
          '@type': 'Answer',
          text: 'We favor moisture-resistant finishes, solid ventilation, hard-wearing flooring, and cabinets/counters that handle real family use—not showroom-only materials.',
        },
      },
    ],
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Kitchen & Bath Remodeling in Killeen, TX | Bar Moon Contracting"
  description="Kitchen and bath remodels in Killeen, TX—durable layouts and finishes for busy Fort Cavazos–area households. Free quotes from Bar Moon Contracting."
  schemas={pageSchemas}
>
  <Header />

  <main class="pt-20 bg-light-neutral text-primary">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
      <div class="mb-8 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <a href="/services" class="text-accent hover:underline">Services</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <span>Kitchen &amp; Bath Remodeling in Killeen, TX</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Kitchen &amp; Bath Remodeling in Killeen, TX</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-10">
        Killeen kitchens and baths take a beating—shift schedules, growing families, hard water, and heat that
        stresses ventilation and finishes. Bar Moon Contracting designs and builds remodels that work for how
        people actually live west of I-14, not just how a magazine kitchen photographs for a weekend.
      </p>

      <div class="prose max-w-none text-gray-700 mb-16 space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">Remodeling for Killeen’s real housing stock</h2>
        <p>
          Killeen’s neighborhoods range from established streets near downtown and Rancier corridors to denser
          subdivisions that serve Fort Cavazos families and long-term residents alike. Many homes share the same
          pattern: solid bones, tired cabinets, baths that lack storage or accessibility, and layouts that never
          matched modern appliances or multi-cook households. A successful remodel here is less about trend
          chasing and more about durable function—clear traffic flow, surfaces that clean easily, and mechanicals
          that can handle Texas humidity.
        </p>
        <p>
          We also see a lot of turnover and “make it work” renovations after moves. That is fine—as long as the
          work is planned with a written scope, realistic allowances, and a schedule that does not leave a family
          without a usable bath for weeks. Our process is built for occupied homes: dust control, daily progress
          updates, and honest talk when demo reveals older plumbing or out-of-square walls.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">What we remodel in Killeen</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Full kitchen remodels: cabinets, countertops, appliances, islands, and layout changes</li>
          <li>Primary and guest baths: walk-in showers, tubs, vanities, tile, and accessibility updates</li>
          <li>Laundry rooms, powder rooms, and mudroom-style entries for high-traffic households</li>
          <li>Custom cabinetry and built-ins where storage is the real problem</li>
          <li>Tile, flooring, painting, lighting, and finish carpentry as part of a coordinated remodel</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">Local factors that change the design</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Hard water and humidity.</strong> Fixtures and shower glass show mineral buildup faster when
          water and bathroom ventilation are not planned together. We push for proper exhaust, moisture-tolerant
          assemblies, and finishes that still look good after years of real use.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Heat and HVAC load.</strong> Opening walls and relocating ducts or returns during a remodel can
          affect comfort. We coordinate mechanical decisions early so a prettier kitchen does not create a hotter
          summer room.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Busy schedules.</strong> Military and shift work are common in the Killeen market. We set clear
          start/finish windows, material lead-time expectations, and decision deadlines so the project does not
          stall mid-demo waiting on a backordered vanity.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Budgets that need to stretch.</strong> Not every remodel is a gut-to-studs showpiece. We help
          prioritize: keep the layout and invest in cabinets and counters, or open the plan and phase finishes.
          Either way, the numbers stay on paper.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">How a Killeen remodel runs with us</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Consultation to map needs, must-haves, and lifestyle (storage, accessibility, resale timing)</li>
          <li>Design direction and material ranges that fit the budget before you fall in love with out-of-scope products</li>
          <li>Detailed quote and timeline with allowances called out clearly</li>
          <li>Demo, rough-in, and finish work with daily communication</li>
          <li>Final walkthrough, punch list, and cleanup</li>
        </ol>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">Killeen kitchen &amp; bath FAQs</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>How long does a kitchen or bath remodel take in Killeen?</strong> Most standard kitchen or bath
          remodels run about 3–6 weeks depending on scope, plumbing/electrical changes, and material lead times.
          We lock a realistic schedule before demo.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Can my family stay in the home during a Killeen remodel?</strong> Yes for most projects. We
          contain dust, protect pathways, and sequence work so you keep a functioning bathroom or temporary
          kitchen plan when possible.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Do you remodel older Killeen and Fort Cavazos–area homes?</strong> Yes. Many area homes have
          dated layouts, limited storage, and plumbing or electrical that needs updating. We plan for surprises
          behind walls without abandoning the budget process.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>What materials hold up in Killeen kitchens and baths?</strong> We favor moisture-resistant
          finishes, solid ventilation, hard-wearing flooring, and cabinets/counters that handle real family
          use—not showroom-only materials.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
          Related pages:{' '}
          <a href="/services/kitchen-bath-remodeling-temple-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline"
            >Kitchen &amp; bath in Temple</a
          >
          {' · '}
          <a href="/services/home-renovations-temple-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline">Home renovations</a>
          {' · '}
          <a href="/services/general-contracting-harker-heights-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline"
            >General contracting in Harker Heights</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-deep-blue text-white p-8 rounded-2xl">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Planning a kitchen or bath update in Killeen?</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-white/90">Durable design, clear pricing, and a schedule that respects a busy household.</p>
        <a href="/get-quote" class="inline-block bg-accent hover:bg-gold text-dark-blue font-bold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg"
          >Get a Remodel Quote</a
        >
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm">
          Call or text: <a href="tel:2545813808" class="text-gold-primary">(254) 581-3808</a> · Mon–Fri 8:00 AM –
          6:00 PM
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
